<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Orion Network Systems Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- said set a year-end price target of $16 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Orion to post a loss of $11.67 in 1997 and a loss of $10.15 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Orion Network gained 5/8 to 11-1/8.</p>
</text>
